    "created_at": "2022-07-09T17:23:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-09T17:24:11Z",
    "body": "I'd like this to be reopened to get someone to look at my spec change suggestion at the bottom of my overlong text:\r\n\r\nI strongly believe that if showPicker() returned a Promise whose resolution indicated selection or cancellation of the modal picker, it would vastly improve the situation.",
