    "created_at": "2022-07-11T17:24:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-11T17:24:48Z",
    "body": "@domenic WDYT about the suggestion for `showPicker()` to return a promise? It'd be backwards compatible (I think) and would offer a standardized way for all pickers to detect what happened. It would seem to beat the approach of [adding `cancel`](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6735) to all inputs with pickers.",
